      <rules>
        <rule name="Repair" id="6121-ab6b-e768-98c5" hidden="false">
          <description>May attempt to repair a damaged hit location on a vehicle, dreadnought, or destroyed support weapon if you can get within range during the movement phase. If making a repair check they cannot fire or fight in close combat that turn.


Roll a D6 at the end of the turn:
5-6: Repairs the damaged part
3-4: Not fixed this turn, but on the next turn will be repaired on a 4+. On a 1-3 it becomes broken beyond repair
1-2: Hopeless, the damage is beyond erpair</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
